riste. Les masses populaires n'ont plus confiance dans votre parti pour conserver le pouvoir. \nHeureusement camarade, toi, tu peux à nouveau essayer de réussir la révolution\""]},{"type":{"value":"Montre"},"parameters":["Relancerlejeu",""]},{"type":{"value":"ActivateBehavior"},"parameters":["Relancerlejeu","ButtonFSM","yes"]},{"type":{"value":"Cache"},"parameters":["Affiche_propagande_alerte"]},{"type":{"value":"Cache"},"parameters":["miniville"]},{"type":{"value":"Cache"},"parameters":["ilfautreprendrePetrograd_TXT1"]},{"type":{"value":"Cache"},"parameters":["ilfautreprendrePetrograd_TXT2"]},{"type":{"value":"Cache"},"parameters":["ilfautreprendreMoscou_TXT1"]},{"type":{"value":"Cache"},"parameters":["ilfautreprendreMoscou_TXT2"]},{"type":{"value":"Cache"},"parameters":["ilfautreprendreMoscouetPetrograd_TXT1"]},{"type":{"value":"Cache"},"parameters":["ilfautreprendreMoscouetPetrograd_TXT2"]}]},{"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::Standard","conditions":[{"type":{"value":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::And"},"parameters":[],"subInstructions":[{"type":{"value":"CompareTimer"},"parameters":["","\"pertePetrograd\"",">=","120"]},{"type":{"value":"CompareTimer"},"parameters":["","\"perteMoscou\"",">=","120"]}]}],"actions":[{"type":{"value":"SetStringVariable"},"parameters":["Resultatpartie","=","\"Moscou_ET_Petrograd_perdu\""]}]},{"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::Standard","conditions":[{"type":{"value":"StringVariable"},"parameters":["Resultatpartie","=","\"Moscou_ET_Petrograd_perdu\""]}],"actions":[{"type":{"value":"Montre"},"parameters":["MessageAcceuil_Arriere_fond",""]},{"type":{"value":"Montre"},"parameters":["MessageAcceuil_Barrerouge",""]},{"type":{"value":"Montre"},"parameters":["MessageAcceuil_Titre1",""]},{"type":{"value":"BBText::SetBBText"},"parameters":["MessageAcceuil_Titre1","=","\"[size=60][b]ECHEC[/b] [/size]\""]},{"type":{"value":"Montre"},"parameters":["MessageAcceuil_Titre2",""]},{"type":{"value":"BBText::SetBBText"},"parameters":["MessageAcceuil_Titre