lé les peuples de l'Est, inspiré les travailleurs de l'Occident, transformé le drapeau rouge. d'une bannière du Parti à une bannière de l'État et rallié autour de cette bannière les peuples des républiques soviétiques afin de les unir en un seul État, l'Union des Républiques socialistes soviétiques, prototype de la future République socialiste soviétique mondiale.\""]},{"type":{"value":"Montre"},"parameters":["Relancerlejeu",""]},{"type":{"value":"ActivateBehavior"},"parameters":["Relancerlejeu","ButtonFSM","yes"]},{"type":{"value":"Cache"},"parameters":["Affiche_propagande_alerte"]},{"type":{"value":"Cache"},"parameters":["miniville"]},{"type":{"value":"Cache"},"parameters":["ilfautreprendrePetrograd_TXT1"]},{"type":{"value":"Cache"},"parameters":["ilfautreprendrePetrograd_TXT2"]},{"type":{"value":"Cache"},"parameters":["ilfautreprendreMoscouetPetrograd_TXT2"]},{"type":{"value":"Cache"},"parameters":["ilfautreprendreMoscouetPetrograd_TXT1"]},{"type":{"value":"Cache"},"parameters":["ilfautreprendreMoscou_TXT1"]},{"type":{"value":"Cache"},"parameters":["ilfautreprendreMoscou_TXT2"]},{"type":{"value":"ChangeLayer"},"parameters":["Background_droite_scenario",""]},{"type":{"value":"ChangeLayer"},"parameters":["TEXTE_SCENARIO_QUESTION_principal",""]},{"type":{"value":"ChangeLayer"},"parameters":["TEXTE_SCENARIO_QUESTION_secondaire",""]},{"type":{"value":"ChangeLayer"},"parameters":["Button_refuse",""]},{"type":{"value":"ChangeLayer"},"parameters":["Button_accepter",""]},{"type":{"value":"ChangeLayer"},"parameters":["Compterendu_discussion_icone",""]}]},{"disabled":true,"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::Standard","conditions":[{"type":{"value":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::And"},"parameters":[],"subInstructions":[{"type":{"value":"CompareTimer"},"parameters":["","\"pertePetrograd\"","<","120"]},{"type":{"value":"CompareTimer"},"parameters":["","\"perteMoscou\"","<","120"]}]}],"actions":[]},{"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::Comment","color":{"b":109,"g":230,"r":255,"textB