[]}],"actions":[{"type":{"value":"SetNumberVariable"},"parameters":["FONCTION_BOUTON_ACCEPTER_SCENARIO","=","0"]}]}]},{"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::Standard","conditions":[{"type":{"value":"NumberVariable"},"parameters":["FONCTION_BOUTON_REFUSER_SCENARIO","=","1"]}],"actions":[],"events":[{"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::Standard","conditions":[],"actions":[{"type":{"value":"SetStringVariable"},"parameters":["Resultatpartie","=","\"Refus_revolution_octobre1917\""]}]},{"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::Standard","conditions":[],"actions":[]}]}]},{"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::Comment","color":{"b":109,"g":230,"r":255,"textB":0,"textG":0,"textR":0},"comment":"\"1erchoix_faire_revolution\" - NON approuvé\n\n En revanche, si vous refusez, vous perdrez l’occasion historique de saisir le pouvoir, condamnant ainsi le projet de construire une société socialiste sur les ruines de l’Empire tsariste. Le choix est décisif : agir maintenant ou risquer l’échec de la révolution.\""},{"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::Standard","conditions":[],"actions":[]}]},{"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::Standard","conditions":[],"actions":[],"events":[{"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::Comment","color":{"b":109,"g":230,"r":255,"textB":0,"textG":0,"textR":0},"comment":"\"2_decresurlaterre\"  - approuvé\n\n\"L'adoption du décret sur la terre entraînera une adhésion massive des populations à la révolution. Concrètement, cela favorisera l'émergence spontanée de gardes rouges dans plusieurs villes de Russie."},{"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::Comment","color":{"b":109,"g":230,"r":255,"textB":0,"textG":0,"textR":0},"comment":"\"2_decresurlaterre\"  - NON approuvé\n\nÀ l'inverse, le refus du décret provoquera un éloignement des masses vis-à-vis de la révolution. Toute tentative ultérieure de confiscation des ressources agricoles se heurtera à des résistances bien plus fortes que si le décret avait été adopté immédiatement. Toutefois, ce refus pourrait éviter une scission au sein du parti socialiste révolutionnaire (SR) et réduire les risques d'attentat contre Lénine, ainsi que la formation d'un gouvernement anti-bolchevique dirigé par les SR.\""}]}]},{"colorB":228,"colorG":176,"colorR":74,"creationTime":0,"name":"17.TUTORIEL fonctionne que durant l'annee 1917 OK","source":"","type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::Group","events":[],"parameters":[]},{"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::Standard","conditions":[{"type":{"value":"NumberVariable"},"parameters":["DATE_MOIS_NUMERIQUE","<","191801"]},{"type":{"value":"BooleanVariable"},"parameters":["tutoriel_fini","<","191801"]}],"actions":[],"events":[{"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::Standard","conditions":[],"actions":[]},{"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::ForEach","object":"soldatblanc","conditions":[{"type":{"value":"StringObjectVariable"},"parameters":["soldatblanc","Souscampsoldatblanc","=","\"KERENSKI\""]}],"actions":[{"type":{"value":"SetNumberVariable"},"parameters":["tutoriel_premiersoldatblanc_X","=","soldatblanc.CenterX()"]},{"type":{"value":"SetNumberVariable"},"parameters":["tutoriel_premiersoldatblanc_Y","=","soldatblanc.CenterY()"]}]},{"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::Standard","conditions":[{"type":{"value":"NumberObjectVariable"},"parameters":["mainjoueur","etape","=","1"]}],"actions":[{"type":{"value":"SetNumberObjectVariable"},"parameters":["mainjoueur","etape","=","2"]},{"type":{"value":"ResetObjectTimer"},"parameters":["mainjoueur","\"main\""]}]},{"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::Standard","conditions":[{"type":{"value":"NumberObjectVariable"},"parameters":["mainjoueur","etape","=","2"]},{"type":{"value":"CompareObjectTimer"},"parameters":["mainjoueur","\"main\"","<=","5"]}],"actions":[{"type":{"value":"AddForceTowardPosition"},"parameters":["mainjoueur","tutoriel_premiersoldatblanc_X+25","tutoriel_premiersoldatblanc_Y+25","60",""]}]},{"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::Standard","conditions":[{"type":{"value":"NumberObjectVariable"},"parameters":["mainjoueur","etape","=